SUMMARY:ARMCHAIR TOUR OF SOUTH BEND CEMETERY
LOCATION:The History Museum | 808 W Washington St | South Bend\, 46601
DESCRIPTION:Archivist and St. Joseph County Historian Travis Childs will gi
 ve a virtual tour of the South Bend City Cemetery in The History Museum's
  auditorium! For anyone who was unable to attend June's cemetery tour\, o
 r who just wants a refresher\, this is a relaxed way to learn about the h
 istory of both the cemetery and the people resting there. Admission is $2
 .00/person or free for members of The History Museum or Studebaker Nation
 al Museum. Admission for children 12 and under is also free.\n\nYou can r
 eserve your spot today at https://historymuseumsb.app.ne...\n\nMore Info:
  https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/armchair-tour-of-south-bend-cemete
 ry/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/armchair-tour-of-south-bend-cemet
 ery/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T153000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
