SUMMARY:FILM—"BACKROOMS: EVERYTHING MUST GO EDITION" (2026)
LOCATION:DeBartolo Performing Arts Center
DESCRIPTION:New at the Browning Directed by Kane Parsons With Chiwetel Ejio
 for\, Renate Reinsve\, Mark Duplass Rated R\, 126 minutes In English\, Po
 rtuguese\, Turkish\, Arabic\, and Japanese with English subtitles A stran
 ge doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom potentially le
 ading to the next generation of Hollywood filmmaking. A summer sensation 
 that many believe finally heralds the gluing of DIY filmmakers to the stu
 dio system\, this version of Backrooms adds 16 minutes to the cut that br
 ought millions out to see what lurks inside the corpse of brick and morta
 r capitalism. GET TICKETS\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/ev
 ents/film-backrooms-everything-must-go-edition-2026-2/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/film-backrooms-everything-must-go
 -edition-2026-2/
