BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b55b03a18c15b0e5f7825518@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260821T191712Z
SUMMARY:SCAVENGER HUNT AT THE MORRIS
LOCATION:The Morris Performing Arts Center | 211 N Michigan St | South Bend
 \, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Morris Performing Arts Center like never before!
  Join Connect 574 for an interactive scavenger hunt that takes you behind
  the scenes and throughout the venue as you solve clues and discover fasc
 inating facts about the historic building.\n\nWhether you’re a first-ti
 me visitor or a longtime patron\, this adventure is a great way to connec
 t with others and learn more about a defining South Bend landmark. Gather
  your own team or have us create one for you\, put your detective skills 
 to the test\, and see if you can complete the hunt before time runs out!\
